{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/118245","id":3493613875,"node_id":"PR_kwDOAO6SJc7QPFEz","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/118245","diff_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/118245.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/118245.patch","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/118245","commits_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/118245/commits","review_comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/118245/comments","review_comment_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/comments{/number}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/118245/comments","statuses_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/statuses/f6e0a42410f01f2726275a8dad036c8252455fe5","number":118245,"state":"closed","locked":false,"title":"Fix incorrect line number passed to external editor from `EditorLog`","user":{"login":"Infiland","id":88491175,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjg4NDkxMTc1","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/88491175?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Infiland","html_url":"https://github.com/Infiland","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Infiland/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Infiland/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Infiland/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Infiland/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Infiland/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Infiland/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Infiland/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Infiland/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Infiland/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"body":"Fixes https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/118228.\n\nWhen clicking a parse error link in EditorLog, `_meta_clicked()` called both `ScriptEditor::edit()` (with the correct line number) and `InspectorDock::edit_resource()`. The latter triggered a second call chain (`_resource_selected` → `push_item` → `_edit_current` → `ScriptEditorPlugin::edit`) that re-opened the script with `line=-1`, overwriting the correct cursor position in the external editor.\n\nThe fix replaces `InspectorDock::edit_resource(res)` with `EditorNode::push_item(res.ptr(), \"\", true)`. The `inspector_only=true` flag still updates the inspector dock and editor history, but skips the `main_plugin->edit()` call in `_edit_current()` that was causing the second unwanted `open_in_external_editor()` invocation.\n\n## Test plan\n\n- Set up an external editor with `{line}` in the Exec Flags\n- Create a GDScript file with a syntax error after line 1\n- Click the parse error in the EditorLog\n- Verify the external editor opens at the correct error line (not line 1)\n- Verify the inspector dock still shows the script resource when clicking the link","labels":[{"id":73330064,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWw3MzMzMDA2NA==","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/bug","name":"bug","description":"","color":"ff6055","default":true,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":279098082,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNzkwOTgwODI=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/topic:gdscript","name":"topic:gdscript","description":"","color":"ffee88","default":false,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":279098219,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNzkwOTgyMTk=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/topic:editor","name":"topic:editor","description":"","color":"ffee88","default":false,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":283518733,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyODM1MTg3MzM=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/usability","name":"usability","description":"","color":"447744","default":false,"archived_at":null,"arch